              "type": "string",
              "value": "Summarize the below text in {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.wordCount}} words, focusing on the topic of {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.topic}} for {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.company}} . If no text is provided, offer a general summary of no more than {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.wordCount}} words on {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.topic}} that can be displayed to a job candidate. \n {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.providedText}}\n\nKEY RULES:\n- Response should be a plain text without any formatting\n- Keep the response in paragraph format. Allow multiple paragraphs ONLY if absolutely required based on the content\n- Response MUST not exceed {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.wordCount}} words\n\nMULTILINGUAL OUTPUT ENFORCEMENT\n- All responses must be entirely in {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.siteLanguage}}\n- Translate all static or hardcoded text before output.\n- Do not use any other language except required proper nouns.\n- If {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.siteLanguage}} is empty, default to English. \n"
            }
          ],
